  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 4.5,
      "text": "Gemini Notebook works best when you use it alongside your specific class materials."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.26,
      "end": 10.24,
      "text": "It keeps your study sessions grounded strictly in the notes, slides, and sources your teacher gave you."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.58,
      "end": 17.48,
      "text": "By focusing on exactly what is on your syllabus, you ensure the information you review is accurate to your specific course,"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.84,
      "end": 20.94,
      "text": "rather than pulling from broad, generalized sources across the internet."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.94,
      "end": 24.32,
      "text": "This graphic illustrates the Gemini Notebook workflow."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.32,
      "end": 30.42,
      "text": "You upload raw information, class notes, PDFs, slide decks, websites, and YouTube videos."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.1,
      "end": 35.26,
      "text": "In return, the tool processes these files to generate practice quizzes, flashcards,"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.68,
      "end": 37.98,
      "text": "study guides, audio overviews, and mind maps."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.72,
      "end": 43.4,
      "text": "Providing a variety of your own source materials gives the system the context it needs"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.4,
      "end": 47.9,
      "text": "to build highly accurate, customized study aids tailored to your curriculum."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.5,
      "end": 54.36,
      "text": "Ultimately, this lets you turn your raw class materials into the exact study tools you need to prepare for your exams."
    }
  ],
